/@souziki_hu/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b77b2e6/uploads/origins/ab70cab7-ae2b-4404-9276-3ad46c8c7210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99d5d6cb1e7253815117f2df41371953", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b77b2e6/uploads/origins/ab70cab7-ae2b-4404-9276-3ad46c8c7210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99d5d6cb1e7253815117f2df41371953, https://si.imgix.net/0b77b2e6/uploads/origins/ab70cab7-ae2b-4404-9276-3ad46c8c7210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c150b25cb87ba76e5b59e4099f3373f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b77b2e6/uploads/origins/ab70cab7-ae2b-4404-9276-3ad46c8c7210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d078efb2e6fc2e5bfdf544063fbdfe4a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のvtuberのCordeliaを描いてくれませんか？\n\nポーズや背景はなんでもOKです!\n\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XDHB1UNXNYBmQ_Hlnq87tczXmxQQsLxI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@souziki_hu/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/312328f0/uploads/origins/2c9e1b87-8814-4a63-8d4a-71014484b222?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2c557b1823ce98fdb2c60b1468c0167", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/312328f0/uploads/origins/2c9e1b87-8814-4a63-8d4a-71014484b222?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2c557b1823ce98fdb2c60b1468c0167, https://si.imgix.net/312328f0/uploads/origins/2c9e1b87-8814-4a63-8d4a-71014484b222?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96f3d8857702a27ba8a429ae2b8f620a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/312328f0/uploads/origins/2c9e1b87-8814-4a63-8d4a-71014484b222?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fed54140817ba6095644ff99150c15e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私はあなたのアートスタイルが本当に好きです。私のVTuberア