de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3170567d26a0f2f8a752e680ef0c43c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50551bba/uploads/origins/4ff852d3-c382-4785-9bd1-61b0686027de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ee6b6c607a79f5e728081c7b92f6764 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!! I would love to see a drawing of my partner, who is part corgi. He's one of those guys who finds things annoying. I am okay with whatever pose, clothing, and background you'd like to draw. (Sorry, I resubmitted because I didn't see the auto-translate turn on)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/fnO89Wt", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@souziki_hu/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64d2c44b/uploads/origins/66259eed-d529-41ac-a518-6d1b4ab025e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=843618fd9f99cd61d8cedd238764f401", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64d2c44b/uploads/origins/66259eed-d529-41ac-a518-6d1b4ab025e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=843618fd9f99cd61d8cedd238764f401, https://si.imgix.net/64d2c44b/uploads/origins/66259eed-d529-41ac-a518-6d1b4ab025e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b483ce13a426e46e7e912dac0b807dd5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64d2c44b/uploads/origins/66259eed-d529-41ac-a518-6d1b4ab025e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93a009e55a89741d869dffee2dc30b3b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I like how clean your art looks. Please draw my character wearing my friend's outfit (preferably the one with the vest).\nOutfit: https://imgur.com/STs8ncH\nCharacter Reference: https://imgur.com/a/8PyAHj4\nExtra Reference for my character's proportions: https://imgur.com/a/mpLwnbt\nI would like a pose that shows off the outfit, but you can do everything as you would like.", "created_at": "", "completed_a